<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Build spacertech batteries, capable of efficiently storing large amounts of energy.-->
  <VFE_AdvancedBatteries.description>建造能够有效存储大量电能的高级蓄电池。</VFE_AdvancedBatteries.description>
  <VFE_AdvancedBatteries.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->the capacitors of tomorrow-->
    <li>subject-&gt;明日电容</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->broke new ground in energy storage, with batteries that hold the promise of tomorrow-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;开辟了能源存储的新天地，让蓄电池拥有了未来</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->crafted compact yet powerful storage solutions, harnessing spacertech to leap forward in efficiency-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;利用太空时代科技打造了紧凑且强力的存储方案，使效率有了质的飞跃</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->pioneered systems that safeguard against power fluctuations, securing energy for critical moments-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;开创使用了防止电力波动的系统，确保关键时刻的能源供给</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->transformed the way civilizations store and manage their power, making energy scarcity a tale of the past-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;改变了文明存储和管理电力的方式，让能源短缺成为历史</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->storing the pulse of progress in advanced batteries-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;将发展的脉冲存储于高级蓄电池中</li>
  </VFE_AdvancedBatteries.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: advanced battery-->
  <VFE_AdvancedBatteries.label>高级蓄电池</VFE_AdvancedBatteries.label>
  <!--EN: Construct spacertech green power generators, including advanced solar panels and wind turbines.-->
  <VFE_AdvancedPowerSources.description>解锁高级可再生能源发电机。</VFE_AdvancedPowerSources.description>
  <VFE_AdvancedPowerSources.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->harvesting the elements-->
    <li>subject-&gt;收获元素</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->harnessed the power of the sun and wind with unprecedented efficiency, through advanced solar panels and turbines-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;借助高级太阳能板和发电机，以极高的效率利用太阳能和风力</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->elevated green power technologies to new heights, combining sustainability with high performance-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;使可持续发展与高性能相结合，将清洁能源技术推向新高度</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->initiated a green revolution in energy production, reducing reliance on finite resources-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;发动清洁能源革命，降低对不可再生资源的依赖</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->integrated smart technologies to optimize energy capture and utilization, even in the most challenging environments-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;集成了智能技术以优化能源汲取与利用，甚至是在那些最险恶的环境中</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->leading the charge towards a sustainable future with green power-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;使用清洁能源引领朝向可持续发展的未来前进</li>
  </VFE_AdvancedPowerSources.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: advanced power sources-->
  <VFE_AdvancedPowerSources.label>高级电力</VFE_AdvancedPowerSources.label>
  <!--EN: Research the helixien gas and it's ability to act as a combustible fuel.-->
  <VFE_GasExtraction.description>研究螺旋气体及其作为可燃燃料的能力。</VFE_GasExtraction.description>
  <!--EN: gas extraction-->
  <VFE_GasExtraction.label>天然气开采</VFE_GasExtraction.label>
  <!--EN: Build industrial-grade generators, capable of storing significantly more fuel and producing higher power.-->
  <VFE_IndustrialGenerators.description>解锁能够存储更多燃料并产生更高功率的工业级发电机。</VFE_IndustrialGenerators.description>
  <VFE_IndustrialGenerators.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->the era of industrial power-->
    <li>subject-&gt;工业发电时代</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->ushered in robust solutions to meet the growing energy demands of burgeoning industries-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;为满足新兴产业与日俱增的能源需求，提出了行之有效的解决方案</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->developed generators with unparalleled fuel efficiency and output, powering the machinery of progress-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;研发了能以极高效率驱动发展之机器的发电机</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->overcame the limitations of earlier power sources, setting the stage for an era of expansion and invention-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;解决了早期能源限制，为扩展与创造的时代布设了舞台</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->engineered durability and reliability into every unit, ensuring the wheels of industry never slow-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;为确保工业的轮轴永不怠工，设计了每个耐用且可靠的单元部件</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->fueling the industrial revolution with advanced power generation-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;利用高级发电机驱动工业革命</li>
  </VFE_IndustrialGenerators.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: industrial generators-->
  <VFE_IndustrialGenerators.label>工业级发电机</VFE_IndustrialGenerators.label>
  <!--EN: The ultimate power generation method, nuclear power is as sufficient as it is deadly.-->
  <VFE_NuclearPower.description>终极电力解决方案。</VFE_NuclearPower.description>
  <VFE_NuclearPower.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->the atomic frontier-->
    <li>subject-&gt;原子开拓者</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->unlocked the atom's heart, unleashing a torrent of power sufficient to light cities and drive the engines of industry-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;解密原子内核，使其释放出能够照亮城市和驱动工业引擎的庞大电力</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->balanced the immense potential with rigorous safety protocols, ensuring the boon of nuclear power wasn't overshadowed by its risks-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;平衡了巨大潜力和严格的安全协议，确保核能之利不会被弊掩盖</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->catalyzed a shift in power generation, where the atom's quiet hum underpins the bustling life of civilizations-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;推动了发电方式的变化，让原子轻柔的嗡鸣声巩固文明的繁忙生活</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->led a scientific and engineering marvel, making nuclear power the cornerstone of a new era of energy sufficiency-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;引领了科学与工程的奇迹，使核能成为新时代能源富足的基石</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->embracing the nucleus of progress with nuclear power-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;以核能拥抱进步发展的核心</li>
  </VFE_NuclearPower.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: nuclear power-->
  <VFE_NuclearPower.label>核电</VFE_NuclearPower.label>
  <!--EN: Build tidal generators on water to produce a large volume of sustainable green energy.-->
  <VFE_TidalPower.description>解锁利用潮汐能发电的发电机。</VFE_TidalPower.description>
  <VFE_TidalPower.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->the rhythm of the seas-->
    <li>subject-&gt;波涛韵律</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->tapped into the ceaseless motion of the oceans, converting the tides into a vast, unending source of power-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;利用大海永不停息的波涌，将潮汐转化成无穷无尽的能源</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->innovated with underwater turbines that dance with the currents, generating clean energy in harmony with nature-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;革新了与水流起舞的水下发电机，生成与自然和谐共处的清洁能源</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->overcame the challenges of marine power generation, protecting ecosystems while harnessing their strength-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;解决了海中发电的难题，既可以利用其力量又能保护生态系统</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->showcased the potential of the planet's largest renewable resource, leading by example in the pursuit of sustainability-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;展现了星球上最庞大可再生资源的潜力，引领可持续发展</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->syncing civilization's heartbeat with the tides-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;让文明之脉动与潮汐同步</li>
  </VFE_TidalPower.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: tidal power-->
  <VFE_TidalPower.label>潮汐发电</VFE_TidalPower.label>
</LanguageData>
